# The whole directory, not just q/*.lic - the platform no longer reads
# binaries or licenses from a local folder at all (see kdb-entrypoint.sh:
# both are pulled from the KX portal / passed as KDB_LICENSE_B64 at
# container start), so nothing under here should ever be tracked again.
# This directory previously had a real KX binary and license committed to
# git (see git history) - if you're reading this after that history was
# ever pushed to a remote, rotate the KX bearer token/license with KX.
